{"id":"6b4df4ff-03ba-4855-9123-b51ba9594223","title":"Mock Tests","cycle":"Placement Preparation","completion":0.0,"availability":"UNLOCKED","duration":72000,"image":"https://d1tgh8fmlzexmh.cloudfront.net/otg_prod/media/ccbp-intensive/Programs/Aptitude/Logical-Reasoning/Logical_Reasoning_Course_2x.png","outcome":"Upon completing this course, you will have significantly enhanced your coding skills in Python, SQL, and JavaScript through rigorous mock tests and real-time project assignments. You will also gain valuable insights into efficient coding strategies, refined time management, and developed the ability to tackle projects resembling those encountered in job interviews. These outcomes will collectively prepare you to excel in coding interviews and perform exceptionally well in interview scenarios.","why":["The purpose of this course is to elevate your coding abilities by immersing you in intensive mock tests for Python, SQL, and JavaScript. Through these tests, you will refine your coding techniques, optimize problem-solving approaches, and improve time management skills. The inclusion of real-time project assignments, mirroring those commonly presented in job interviews, will provide hands-on experience and instill the confidence to handle practical challenges. By successfully completing these assignments, you will be well-equipped to thrive in coding interviews, showcasing your proficiency and problem-solving prowess with confidence and excellence."],"topics":[{"id":"86d134bf-b7a6-42a2-a0f4-86ae4db64aeb","name":"Intro to Mock Tests","order":1,"locked":false,"units":[{"id":"15b83664-6702-4148-a12e-3915987c3ac0","name":"Course Introduction","type":"LEARNING_SET","content_type":"DEFAULT","resource_type":"DEFAULT","locked":false,"duration":600,"resources":[{"id":"d7a6745d-919d-439b-b3da-e7269fc2696b","title":"Course Introduction","type":"DEFAULT","format":"MARKDOWN","language":"ENGLISH","content":"## Mock Tests\n\nWelcome to the comprehensive course designed to turbocharge your coding abilities and boost your readiness for technical challenges.\n\n**1. Elevate Your Coding Proficiency**\n\nThis course is your gateway to refining your coding skills through a series of programming tests that cover Python, SQL, and JavaScript. These tests are like practice runs for real coding challenges.\n\n**2. Unveiling Real-World Projects**\n\nBrace yourself for real-time project assignments that mirror the ones in job interviews. These projects aren't just tasks; they're hands-on experiences that prepare you for the coding world out there.\n\n\n<MultiLineNote>\n- This course is more than just theory; it's a practical journey that equips you with coding skills and interview readiness.\n</MultiLineNote>","slides":[],"videos":{},"languages":[]}]}]},{"id":"47eb937b-d9ab-406c-9965-a3f741919c8a","name":"Module - 1","order":2,"locked":false,"units":[{"id":"2bbbaffd-4754-439e-9163-b4327b3cde55","name":null,"type":"EXAM","content_type":null,"resource_type":null,"locked":false,"duration":5400,"resources":[]},{"id":"bc1facc0-0147-4d5f-8980-81cd5b4db8ad","name":null,"type":"EXAM","content_type":null,"resource_type":null,"locked":false,"duration":5400,"resources":[]},{"id":"ff111979-9a57-4d8f-9d18-5e9bd61f1bff","name":null,"type":"EXAM","content_type":null,"resource_type":null,"locked":false,"duration":1200,"resources":[]},{"id":"b01be7de-c18e-4bed-928b-b0bd459d3da9","name":null,"type":"EXAM","content_type":null,"resource_type":null,"locked":false,"duration":1200,"resources":[]}]},{"id":"8099a2ee-ae77-4f49-81dc-1518a25a2799","name":"Module - 2","order":3,"locked":false,"units":[{"id":"78a60acb-762f-4399-af44-b331a385ef95","name":null,"type":"EXAM","content_type":null,"resource_type":null,"locked":false,"duration":5400,"resources":[]},{"id":"02a6cca8-bb8f-43cf-93af-0c607a73169c","name":null,"type":"QUESTION_SET","content_type":null,"resource_type":null,"locked":false,"duration":0,"resources":[]},{"id":"9a235ca2-f0c1-4b0b-80ff-30c3422951c3","name":null,"t